DT084 - DUYET CAY THEO MUC VA XAC DINH DO RONG TUNG MUC
Ca: A01_ViDu1_PhieuGiao
Input: goc=1; n=4
Danh sach nut: [(1, 10, 2, 3), (2, 20, 4, 0), (3, 30, 0, 0), (4, 40, 0, 0)]
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Duyet theo thu tu hang doi FIFO:
  - Thu tu ID nut   : 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4
  - Thu tu gia tri  : 10 -> 20 -> 30 -> 40

Phan nhom theo tung muc (cac_muc):
  * Muc  0 (do rong  1): Any[10]
  * Muc  1 (do rong  2): Any[20, 30]
  * Muc  2 (do rong  1): Any[40]

Thong ke do rong va muc rong nhat:
  - Do rong tung muc : [1, 2, 1]
  - Do rong lon nhat : 2
  - Muc dau tien dat : 1
  - Trung binh muc   : Union{Nothing, Float64}[10.0, 25.0, 40.0]

Thong so van hanh hang doi (Kiem chung chi phi):
  - So luot nut vao queue : 4
  - So luot nut ra queue  : 4
  - Dung luong queue toi da: 2
