Vui long nhap lua chon cua ban (0..12): ========================================================================================================================
KHAO SAT THUC NGHIEM 3 QUY MO N = 3, N = 7, N = 31 (SO SANH CAY LECH VS CAY NHI PHAN DAY)
Phuong phap: dem so luot vao/ra queue va so nut dang cho lon nhat; khong do thoi gian.
========================================================================================================================
Cỡ N   | Dang cay         | Chieu cao | Vao Queue  | Ra Queue   | Queue Max (O)  | Rong nhat    | Muc rong nhat
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3      | Day lech phai    | 2        | 3          | 3          | 1              | 1            | 0           
3      | Nhi phan day     | 1        | 3          | 3          | 2              | 2            | 1           
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7      | Day lech phai    | 6        | 7          | 7          | 1              | 1            | 0           
7      | Nhi phan day     | 2        | 7          | 7          | 4              | 4            | 2           
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
31     | Day lech phai    | 30       | 31         | 31         | 1              | 1            | 0           
31     | Nhi phan day     | 4        | 31         | 31         | 16             | 16           | 4           
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NHAN XET KHAO SAT QUY MO:
1. Tong so luot vao va ra queue = 2*n. Ket hop phan tich moi buoc O(1), loi duyet ton O(n).
2. Dung luong queue cuc dai:
   - Cay lech: chi 1 nut dang cho. Mang queue trong code van cap phat n o, khong phai bo nho O(1).
   - Cac cay day trong bang: queue max=ceil(n/2) (n=31: 16 nut). Xau nhat O(n).
3. max_queue_len la so nut dang cho, khac so o da cap phat; queue va nhom ket qua deu dung O(n) bo nho.
========================================================================================================================


